At 50\%, C1 matches KL within statistical noise across all five metrics (max $\Delta$=0.59pp, 2-seed), while standard BCE on magnitude masks yields PPL 28.13$\pm$0.20 (3-seed, Table~\ref{tab:main}), $2.4\times$ worse.
